src/llm_behavior_eval/security/rules/scenarios.py reproduces the scenario
prompt templates, the fixed assistant acknowledgement, the rule-precedence
reminders and the scenarios' evaluation logic from llm_rules/message.py and
llm_rules/scenarios/{scenario,utils,security,games}.py. Changes: type hints;
random parameter generation, its word lists and the redacted prompts removed.
dataset.py, scorer.py and metrics.py reimplement the test-case loading,
conversation loop, answer post-processing and score aggregation of
llm_rules/scripts/evaluate.py, llm_rules/scripts/read_scores.py,
llm_rules/scripts/metadata.yaml and the model wrappers' remove_cot for Inspect.

The RuLES test cases (llm_rules/data, Apache-2.0) are not included; they are
downloaded from that commit at run time.
